  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/09/ObrasAnelsmoCoyneCalleParisOnda120914.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La ma&ntilde;ana de este viernes continuaban las obras en la calle Anselmo Coyn&eacute;, en la esquina con la calle Par&iacute;s, junto al IES Serra d&#39;Espad&agrave; y el Museu del Taulell &#39;Manolo Safont&#39; de Onda, que afectan al paso de cebra. Hasta este jueves se han realizado trabajos en la otra esquina, en la calle Herminia Landerer, donde paran los autobuses escolares.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/obresanselmocoynecarrerparisonda120914/obrasanelsmocoynecalleparisonda120914-1.jpg\" alt=\"obrasanelsmocoynecalleparisonda120914-1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/obresanselmocoynecarrerparisonda120914/obrasanelsmocoynecalleparisonda120914-2.jpg\" alt=\"obrasanelsmocoynecalleparisonda120914-2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/obresanselmocoynecarrerparisonda120914/obrasanelsmocoynecalleparisonda120914-3.jpg\" alt=\"obrasanelsmocoynecalleparisonda120914-3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/obresanselmocoynecarrerparisonda120914/obrasanelsmocoynecalleparisonda120914-4.jpg\" alt=\"obrasanelsmocoynecalleparisonda120914-4\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/obresanselmocoynecarrerparisonda120914/obrasanelsmocoynecalleparisonda120914-5.jpg\" alt=\"obrasanelsmocoynecalleparisonda120914-5\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/obresanselmocoynecarrerparisonda120914/obrasanelsmocoynecalleparisonda120914.jpg\" alt=